IT:
{{TAG:0003:0012:}}Che meraviglia! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Sei davvero tu?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}? {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Da quanto tempo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Mi sono trasferita {{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
